:null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-01-04T01:42:35Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T23:59:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101114","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101114.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101114.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The following methods are available:\r\n\r\n- `EditorInterface.is_2d_editor_grid_snap_enabled()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.is_2d_editor_smart_snap_enabled()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.is_2d_editor_snap_relative_enabled()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.is_2d_editor_snap_rotation_enabled()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.is_2d_editor_snap_scale_enabled()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_grid_offset()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_grid_offset()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_grid_primary_steps()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_grid_step()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_snap_rotation_offset()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_snap_rotation_step()`\r\n- `EditorInterface.get_2d_editor_snap_scale_step()`\r\n\r\nNote that in 3D, the grid size is defined by the `editors/3d/grid_size` editor setting, but it's separate from snapping which is defined on a per-scene basis like in 2D. I suggest unifying this to make it work more like the 2D editor before adding methods that expose it to editor plugins.\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10529.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test-2d-editor-grid-plugin.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18305054/test-2d-editor-grid-plugin.zip)\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101114/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101114/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}